{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37857","headline":"黔中书事 · 许彬","name":"黔中书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巴蜀水南偏，山穷塞垒宽。\n岁时将近腊，草树未知寒。\n独狖啼朝雨，羣牛向暮滩。\n更闻蛮俗近，烽火不艰难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}